      "Shows how to document endpoints from TypeScript and JSDoc annotations.",
      "Provides Swagger UI setup guidance for interactive API references.",
      "Creates authentication, pagination, rate limit, and error handling sections.",
      "Suggests a documentation folder structure for guides, examples, and references."
    ],
